```java
public void applyUpdates() {
    updateMap.values().stream().sorted()
        .forEach(upd -> upd.getArg().setType(upd.getType()));
}
public List<TypeUpdateEntry> getSortedUpdates() {
    return updateMap.values().stream().sorted().collect(Collectors.toList());
}
```

`applyUpdates` can reuse `getSortedUpdates()`:
```java
public void applyUpdates() {
    getSortedUpdates().forEach(upd -> upd.getArg().setType(upd.getType()));
}
```

Eliminates one of the two identical `.stream().sorted()` pipelines; `Collectors` import can then be removed from `TypeUpdateInfo`.

