```

Two separate streams iterate the same `Set<BlockNode>`. One loop computes both values:
```java
int notEmptyBlocks = 0, insnsCount = 0;
for (BlockNode block : toRemove) {
    int size = block.getInstructions().size();
    if (size > 0) { notEmptyBlocks++; insnsCount += size; }
}
```

